{"title":"Hypertask pricing, free trial and Free plan limits","slug":"pricing-plans","excerpt":"Free is $0 forever, with unlimited members, unlimited open tickets and up to 3 owned boards. Paid plans per user per month: BYOK $10 monthly or $8 billed yearly, Pro $20 monthly or $16 billed yearly. Paid plans come with a 14-day trial. Upgrade in Settings > Plans.","category":"cat-12128993","html":"<p>Hypertask has three plans: <strong>Free</strong>, <strong>BYOK</strong> and <strong>Pro</strong>. The current price list is always on the pricing page: <a href="https://hypertask.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://hypertask.ai/pricing</a></p>
<h2>Is Hypertask free?</h2>
<p>Yes. The Free plan costs $0 and is free forever. You can use it with your whole team.</p>
<h2>Is there a free trial?</h2>
<p>Yes. Paid plans come with a 14-day trial (also asked as &quot;free trial&quot;, &quot;trial period&quot;, &quot;how long is the trial&quot; or misspelled &quot;trail&quot;). The Free plan itself is free forever, with no trial needed.</p>
<h2>How many people are included in a free team?</h2>
<p>There is no member limit on the Free plan. A free team can have unlimited members, so you can invite as many people (users) as you need.</p>
<h2>How many boards and tickets can I have on Free? (board and ticket limits)</h2>
<p>On the Free plan you get unlimited members and unlimited open tickets. You can own up to 3 boards. Archived boards are not counted. A paid or trialing plan has no board limit.</p>
<h2>What are the limitations of the Free plan?</h2>
<p>Free plan limits (also asked as &quot;freeplan&quot;, &quot;free tier&quot;, &quot;free version&quot; or &quot;free account&quot; limits, limitations or restrictions): A free team gets unlimited members and unlimited open tickets, and each person can own up to 3 boards (archived boards are not counted). It costs $0, is free forever, and needs no credit card. A paid or trialing plan has no board limit.</p>
<p>What Free does not include, compared with paid plans:</p>
<ul><li>More than 3 owned boards. Paid and trialing plans have no board limit.</li><li>Free includes a small starter AI allowance on fast budget models. For more AI, Pro includes more AI on Hypertask's managed models, or BYOK runs AI on your own keys.</li><li>Integrations come with Pro.</li><li>Support on Free is email support. Pro gets priority support.</li><li>File uploads: Free includes file uploads and storage. This article does not list file size or total storage limits, so don't promise a storage number or unlimited storage; point to <a href="https://hypertask.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://hypertask.ai/pricing</a> for current details.</li></ul>
<h2>Do I need a credit card to start?</h2>
<p>No. You don't need a credit card to start. Sign up with <strong>Start for free</strong> (<a href="https://app.hypertask.ai/login)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://app.hypertask.ai/login)</a> and choose a paid plan only when you are ready.</p>
<h2>How much does Hypertask cost?</h2>
<p>Paid plans are priced per user (per seat). You can pay yearly or monthly.</p>
<p><strong>Billed yearly</strong></p>
<ul><li>BYOK: $8 per user / month ($96 per user / year)</li><li>Pro: $16 per user / month ($192 per user / year)</li></ul>
<p><strong>Billed monthly</strong></p>
<ul><li>BYOK: $10 per user / month</li><li>Pro: $20 per user / month</li></ul>
<p>Free is $0. Paying yearly saves 20%.</p>
<h2>Seats on paid plans</h2>
<p>BYOK and Pro are offered for teams of up to 50 seats, billed monthly or yearly. When someone joins a team on a paid plan, the number of seats on the subscription is updated.</p>
<p>The pricing page lists only these monthly and yearly prices, for up to 50 seats. It does not list volume discounts, multi-year plans or paying by invoice, so we can't promise any of those here. To ask about more than 50 seats or other billing needs, email help@hypertask.ai or ask here to talk to a human on the team.</p>
<h2>What each plan includes</h2>
<p><strong>Free</strong></p>
<ul><li>Unlimited members and unlimited open tickets</li><li>Own up to 3 boards (archived boards are not counted)</li><li>A small included starter AI allowance on fast budget models</li><li>CLI and MCP access for AI agents</li><li>Email support</li></ul>
<p><strong>BYOK (bring your own key)</strong></p>
<ul><li>All AI features, running on your own API keys from Anthropic, OpenAI or OpenRouter</li><li>Up to 50 team seats</li><li>CLI and MCP access</li><li>Email support</li></ul>
<p><strong>Pro</strong> (for teams that want more AI, with no keys to manage, plus integrations)</p>
<ul><li>Everything in BYOK</li><li>More AI included, on Hypertask's managed models, with no API keys to manage</li><li>Integrations</li><li>Priority support</li></ul>
<h2>How much AI is included?</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Free:</strong> a small included starter allowance of AI on fast budget models.</li><li><strong>Pro:</strong> more AI included, on Hypertask's managed models. No keys to manage.</li><li><strong>BYOK:</strong> AI runs on your own Anthropic, OpenAI or OpenRouter keys.</li></ul>
<p>The app shows how much of this month's included AI your team has used: the team owner or a board admin can see it in <strong>Settings → AI Usage</strong>.</p>
<h2>How to upgrade</h2>
<p>In the Hypertask app, open <strong>Settings → Plans</strong> (<a href="https://app.hypertask.ai/settings/plans)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://app.hypertask.ai/settings/plans)</a>, choose BYOK or Pro, then pick monthly or yearly billing.</p>
<h2>Questions about price or billing</h2>
<p>See <a href="https://hypertask.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://hypertask.ai/pricing</a>, email help@hypertask.ai, or ask here to talk to a human on the team.</p>","plansHtml":"<section class="plan-board" aria-label="Hypertask plans">
    <style>
.plan-board { margin: 8px 0 28px; color: var(--ink, #f4f4f7); container-type: inline-size; }
.plan-board * { box-sizing: border-box; }
.plan-toggle {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  width: fit-content;
  max-width: 100%;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  background: var(--surface, #0b0b0d);
  border: 1px solid var(--surface-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.14));
  border-radius: 10px;
}
.plan-billing-input {
  position: absolute;
  opacity: 0;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  margin: 0;
}
.plan-toggle label {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px;
  min-height: 36px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: var(--muted, #a7a8ad);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.plan-billing-input:checked + label {
  background: var(--btn-bg, #ffffff);
  color: var(--btn-fg, #000000);
}
.plan-billing-input:focus-visible + label { outline: 2px solid var(--ink, #f4f4f7); outline-offset: 2px; }
.plan-save { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
.plan-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.plan-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 18px 16px 16px;
  background: var(--surface, #0b0b0d);
  border: 1px solid var(--surface-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.14));
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 14px);
}
.plan-name {
  font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.plan-who { margin: 8px 0 14px; color: var(--muted, #a7a8ad); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; }
.plan-price { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; margin: 0; }
.plan-amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; }
.plan-unit, .plan-detail, .plan-alt { color: var(--muted, #a7a8ad); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
.plan-detail, .plan-alt { margin: 4px 0 0; }
.plan-points { list-style: none; margin: 16px 0; padding: 0; flex: 1; }
.plan-points li { position: relative; margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; }
.plan-points li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0.5em;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ink, #f4f4f7);
}
.plan-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 40px;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  background: var(--btn-bg, #ffffff);
  color: var(--btn-fg, #000000);
  border-radius: var(--radius-btn, 8px);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.plan-cta:hover { background: var(--primary-hover, #d9d9d9); }
.plan-note { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--muted, #a7a8ad); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
.plan-note a { color: var(--ink, #f4f4f7); white-space: nowrap; }
.plan-board .price-monthly { display: none; }
.plan-board:has(#ht-plan-monthly:checked) .price-yearly { display: none; }
.plan-board:has(#ht-plan-monthly:checked) .price-monthly { display: block; }
.plan-board:has(#ht-plan-monthly:checked) .plan-price .price-monthly { display: inline; }
@container (max-width: 640px) {
  .plan-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .plan-toggle { width: 100%; }
  .plan-toggle label { flex: 1; }
}
</style>
    <div class="plan-toggle" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Billing period">
